~ take_this
Boss: Hey, kid.

Boss: Take this {{DeliveryManager.current_snack.snack_name}} to {{DeliveryManager.get_delivery_target_name()}}.

=> END

~ welcome_back
Boss: Nice work, kid.

Boss: Your next delivery is this {{DeliveryManager.current_snack.snack_name}} for {{DeliveryManager.get_delivery_target_name()}}.

Boss: And make it quick!

=> END

~ already_have_snack
Boss: What are you waiting for?!

Boss: Go deliver {{DeliveryManager.current_snack.snack_name}} to {{DeliveryManager.get_delivery_target_name()}}.

=> END

~ not_configured
Boss: There's no deliveries for you right now.

Boss: Go build some sandcastles or something.

=> END